M.\n\n**English**\n\nQBERS League In Astana 2025 is an open competition in Astana.\n\nThe base registration fee for any number of events is 5000 tenge.\n\nThe main event of the competition is QBERS League. QBERS League is an unofficial event that will be held in the format of a tournament grid. For more information about QBERS League, see the tabs.\n\nThese competition is organized by QBERS TEAM.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","externalWebsite":null}